  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Benue Recovery Initiative for Development, Growth, and Empowerment (BRIDGE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Benue Recovery Initiative for Development, Growth, and Empowerment (BRIDGE) is a six-month livelihood project in Daudu IDP Camps, Benue State. Implemented by FJDP, it will empower 100 displaced persons&#x2014;mainly women and persons with disabilities&#x2014;through vocational training, start-up kits, business coaching, and savings groups. The project promotes self-reliance, reduces negative coping strategies, and fosters financial resilience, directly benefiting 100 IDPs and indirectly supporting their households, in line with CAFOD&#x2019;s mission of dignity, justice, and sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
